      "listing": "Video; the page could not be read here (blocked), so the movement follows the name and standard coaching (half-kneeling side-on to a chest-height pulley, press out and hold square).",
      "note": "Reference used only to identify the movement. No GymVisual media is stored here; this rig, model and animation are original."
    },
    "type": "Strength",
    "bodyPart": "Waist (core, anti-rotation)",
    "secondaryBodyParts": [
      "Shoulders",
